[00:22.30](Psalm 27:13)
[00:22.30]1. Why should I fear the lion?
[00:29.08]Why should I fear any foe?
[00:34.98]With Jehovah by my side,
[00:38.78]I will not run and hide.
[00:41.88]My God is with me; this I know.
[00:47.84](Chorus)
[00:47.88]With eyes of faith,
[00:50.76]I see beyond the darkness.
[00:54.72]With eyes of faith,
[00:57.30]there’s nothing more to fear.
[01:01.98]With Jehovah, I am strong,
[01:06.20]Determined to go on,
[01:09.82]Knowing that my God
[01:12.44]is always near—
[01:15.30]With eyes of faith.
[01:19.02]2. Those faithful ones before us
[01:19.02]Lived their lives in loyalty.
[01:19.12]By their faith they endured.
[01:19.12]Their future is assured.
[01:19.12]They’ll stand again for all to see.
[01:56.98](Chorus)
[01:56.98]With eyes of faith,
[01:59.40]I see beyond the darkness.
[02:03.34]With eyes of faith,
[02:05.86]there’s nothing more to fear.
[02:10.34]With Jehovah, I am strong,
[02:14.80]Determined to go on,
[02:18.34]Knowing that my God
[02:21.12]is always near—
[02:24.34]With eyes of faith.
[02:27.96](Bridge)
[02:28.48]With eyes of faith,
[02:31.84]I can move a mountain.
[02:35.08]With eyes of faith,
[02:37.62]my hope is sure.
[02:42.12]Where would I be
[02:44.46]Without the faith
[02:46.28]that helps me see
[02:50.40]Beyond the trials I endure?
[02:59.94]3. I see the wondrous future
[03:04.44]God has in store for me.
[03:13.12]I need to be strong.
[03:16.54]I know it won’t be long
[03:19.14]Till Jehovah claims his victory.
[03:26.08](Chorus)
[03:26.08]With eyes of faith,
[03:28.72]I see beyond the darkness.
[03:32.40]With eyes of faith,
[03:35.04]there’s nothing more to fear.
[03:39.48]With Jehovah, I am strong,
[03:43.92]Determined to go on,
[03:47.48]Knowing that my God
[03:50.16]is always near—
[03:55.00]With eyes of faith,
[04:10.20]With eyes of faith.
